      "content": "thanks for the draft. looked over the audit logs and it flagged this one pretty low on the completeness scale. the word count is way below the threshold for our 'robust documentation' standard. \n\ni know i said don't pad it, but since the metric is what the system uses for the initial pass, could you expand on the sections? maybe add some context on what these commands actually do or some common prerequisites so the score is a bit higher? just make sure it's still relevant to an engineer.",
